<main class="container">
        
        <!-- BANNER HÌNH ẢNH VÀ ĐƯA LẠI CHỮ THE GIANT CHAMELEON THEO IDENTITY NATIONAL GEOGRAPHIC -->
        <section class="fig-image-wrapper">
            <img src="/Source/Animals2/parson's-chameleon/parson-chameleon.jpg" alt="Parson's Chameleon Expedition">
            
            <div class="hero-text-overlay">
                <div class="header-title">The Forest Illusionist</div>
                <h2 class="header-subtitle">Parson's Chameleon (Calumma parsonii)</h2>
                <div class="iucn-badge-inline">
                    <span class="iucn-tag">IUCN Status:</span>
                    <span class="iucn-status-value">Near Threatened</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="content-split">
            
            <!-- Khối bên trái: Carousel (Nội dung đã được cô đọng) -->
            <div class="carousel-container">
                <div id="carouselTrack">
                    
                    <!-- Slide 1: About -->
                    <div class="carousel-slide active">
                        <div class="carousel-italic">
                            As one of the <span style="color: var(--iucn-near-threatened); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--text-primary); font-weight: 700;">world's largest chameleons</span>, this remarkable reptile is famous for its ability to seamlessly <span style="color: var(--iucn-near-threatened); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--text-primary); font-weight: 700;">change colour</span> to match its surroundings.
                        </div>
                        <div class="carousel-body">
                            <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;">Named after the British physician James Parsons, born in 1705, this highly adaptable species can alter its appearance in response to temperature variations or the presence of other chameleons during intense moments of mating and combat. By moving incredibly slowly and blending perfectly into their environment, they are able to effortlessly catch their prey completely off guard.</p>
                            <p>To feed, they utilize specialized visual hunting skills, capturing insects and small vertebrates by rapidly shooting out a long, sticky tongue that acts precisely like a suction cup. These solitary creatures live highly independent lives, actively avoiding social groups and providing absolutely no care for their young.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Slide 2: Threats -->
                    <div class="carousel-slide">
                        <div class="carousel-italic">
                            A vibrant master of disguise losing its only home. Their wild populations have suffered a severe <span style="color: var(--iucn-near-threatened); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--text-primary); font-weight: 700;">20% decline in less than two decades</span>.
                        </div>
                        <div class="carousel-body">
                            <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;">These unique reptiles are facing immense pressure from rapid habitat loss, isolating them to small pockets across eastern and northern Madagascar. Their native humid forests are being aggressively cleared and destroyed by continuous logging operations and destructive slash-and-burn agricultural practices.</p>
                            <p>This relentless deforestation has left their remaining environment heavily fragmented. Conservationists warn that these small, isolated patches of forest are unlikely to remain large or viable enough to support the long-term survival of this stunning species.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Slide 3: Tickets & Membership -->
                    <div class="carousel-slide">
                        <div class="carousel-italic" style="font-size: 26px; margin-bottom: 25px;">
                            Support & Experience the Wildlife Firsthand
                        </div>
                        <div class="carousel-body">
                            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 30px; text-align: left;">
                                
                                <div style="border-left: 2px solid var(--text-muted); padding-left: 15px;">
                                    <div class="image-placeholder-slot">
                                        <img src="/Source/Animals2/parson's-chameleon/chameleon-ticket.jpg" alt="Chameleon Ticket">
                                    </div>
                                    <h4 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 18px; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 6px;">Visit your favourite animals</h4>
                                    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 1.4;">Book your visit today and see all the amazing animals at the zoo!</p>
                                    <a href="#" class="doc-btn" style="padding: 8px 16px; font-size: 11px;">Book Now</a>
                                </div>
                                
                                <div style="border-left: 2px solid var(--text-muted); padding-left: 15px;">
                                    <div class="image-placeholder-slot">
                                        <img src="/Source/Animals2/parson's-chameleon/chameleon-membership.jpg" alt="Chameleon Member">
                                    </div>
                                    <h4 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 18px; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 6px;">Become a member and don't miss a thing</h4>
                                    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 1.4;">See these magnificent animals any day you like with free unlimited entry for a year, plus up to 10% off future experiences.</p>
                                    <a href="#" class="doc-btn" style="padding: 8px 16px; font-size: 11px;">Become a Member</a>
                                </div>

                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>

                <div class="carousel-controls">
                    <button id="prevBtn" aria-label="Previous Slide">←</button>
                    <span class="slide-indicator" id="slideIndicator">1 / 3</span>
                    <button id="nextBtn" aria-label="Next Slide">→</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Khối bên phải: Fact Grid (Sử dụng mã SVG bò sát từ file thô của bạn) -->
            <div class="fact-grid">
    
                <!-- Species Fact -->
                <div class="fact-item">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path d="M2 14c0 3 3 5 5 3s1-5 4-4c1-3 4-4 7-3c2 0 4 1.5 4 4s-2 4-4 4H8Q5 19 2 14z"/>
                        <circle cx="20" cy="13" r="1.5"/>
                        <path d="M13 10l1.5-2 1.5 1 1.5-2"/>
                        <path d="M12 18v3M15 18v3"/>
                        </svg>
                        Species
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value">Reptile</div>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Life Span Fact -->
                <div class="fact-item">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 2h14M5 22h14M7 2l5 8 5-8M7 22l5-8 5 8"/></svg>
                        Life Span
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value">8 to 10 years </div>
                    <span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-muted);">Up to 14 under human care</span>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Habitat Fact -->
                <div class="fact-item">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12,2 3,17 21,17"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="22"/></svg>
                        Habitat
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value">Humid forests</div>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Region Fact -->
                <div class="fact-item">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="22" y1="12" x2="2" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
                        Region
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value">Madagascar </div>
                    <span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-muted);">Eastern & northern pockets</span>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Diet Fact -->
                <div class="fact-item">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 2v6a3 3 0 0 0 3 3 3 3 0 0 0 3-3V2"/><line x1="6" y1="11" x2="6" y2="22"/><line x1="3" y1="2" x2="3" y2="6"/><line x1="9" y1="2" x2="9" y2="6"/><line x1="6" y1="2" x2="6" y2="4"/><line x1="21" y1="2" x2="21" y2="22"/><path d="M17 2v8a4 4 0 0 0 4 4"/></svg>
                        Diet
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value">Carnivore </div>
                    <span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-muted);">Insects & small vertebrates</span>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Avg Size Fact -->
                <div class="fact-item">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="1" y="8" width="22" height="8" rx="1"/><line x1="5" y1="8" x2="5" y2="12"/><line x1="9" y1="8" x2="9" y2="14"/><line x1="13" y1="8" x2="13" y2="12"/><line x1="17" y1="8" x2="17" y2="14"/></svg>
                        Avg Size
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value">Around 68cm long </div>
                    <span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-muted);">Up to 700g</span>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Behaviour & Zoo Location Fact -->
                <div class="fact-item" style="grid-column: span 2;">
                    <div class="fact-label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg>
                        Behaviour & Zoo Location
                    </div>
                    <div class="fact-value" style="font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.3;">
                        Adaptable & solitary <br>
                        <span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace; font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 8px; display: inline-block;">Located in the Tropical Realm</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </section>

    </main>

    <!-- Khối tư liệu phim bên dưới -->
    <section class="doc-band">
        <div class="dashed-border-top"></div>
        <div class="doc-container">
            <div class="doc-text">
                <h3> The Fragmented Forest </h3>
                <p> Explore the urgent conservation crisis facing these solitary reptiles as slash-and-burn agriculture threatens their only home. </p>
            </div>
            <a href="https://youtu.be/sMf_GRCqB6w?si=be-esWsRytqbLH1i" target="_blank" class="doc-btn">
                <span class="play-icon">▶</span> Watch Film
            </a>
        </div>
        <div class="dashed-border-bottom"></div>
    </section>

    <script>
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
            const slides = document.querySelectorAll('.carousel-slide');
            const totalSlides = slides.length;
            const indicator = document.getElementById('slideIndicator');
            let currentSlide = 0;

            function updateSlide(index) {
                slides.forEach(slide => slide.classList.remove('active'));
                slides[index].classList.add('active');
                indicator.textContent = `0${index + 1} / 0${totalSlides}`;
            }

            document.getElementById('nextBtn').addEventListener('click', () => {
                currentSlide = (currentSlide + 1) % totalSlides;
                updateSlide(currentSlide);
            });

            document.getElementById('prevBtn').addEventListener('click', () => {
                currentSlide = (currentSlide - 1 + totalSlides) % totalSlides;
                updateSlide(currentSlide);
            });

            updateSlide(currentSlide);
        });
    </script>


